        "answer": {
          "short": "$S_n=\\dfrac{n(2+n\\sqrt2-3\\sqrt2)}{2}$",
          "worked": "$a=1-\\sqrt2,\\ d=\\sqrt2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}S_n&=\\frac{n}{2}\\left[2(1-\\sqrt2)+(n-1)\\sqrt2\\right]\\\\S_n&=\\frac{n(2-2\\sqrt2+n\\sqrt2-\\sqrt2)}{2}\\\\S_n&=\\frac{n(2+n\\sqrt2-3\\sqrt2)}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
